        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Mecca</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">5th century CE – present; by tradition far older</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">Islamic tradition attributes its beginnings to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abraham">Abraham</a>, Hagar and Ishmael; historians note that its early history is poorly documented, and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/quraysh">Quraysh</a> took control in the 5th century</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">A narrow valley in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hejaz">Hejaz</a> mountains of western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arabia">Arabia</a>, 277 m above sea level and about 70 km inland from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jeddah">Jeddah</a> on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/red-sea">Red Sea</a>, in present-day Saudi Arabia</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kaaba">Kaaba</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/masjid-al-haram">Masjid al-Haram</a>; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hajj">Hajj</a> and 'Umrah pilgrimages; the birthplace of Muhammad; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/quraysh">Quraysh</a> and their caravan trade; the conquest of 630; the Zamzam <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/well">Well</a>; the rule of the sharifs</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">It is the capital of Mecca Province in Saudi <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arabia">Arabia</a>, the holiest city of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/islam">Islam</a>, which non-Muslims may not enter.</span></div>
